Readline: line editing and history of the interactive CLI (php74 -a),
with GNU readline of the package az.

The module readline of PHP 7.4 for php74 of azsupport/ports, which
installs side by side with the other versions of PHP:
lib/php/20190902/readline.so, loaded by its ini in etc/php74/conf.d,
its headers in include/php74/php/ext/readline.
